    <Document id="1">
        <name>Mula-Mutha River - NDSI Salinity (Odeh &amp; Onus 2008)</name>
        <description>River-masked NDSI salinity classification. Non-river speckle/noise pixels removed; only the connected river channel retained; boundary smoothed from the source raster.</description>
